// ++++++++++++++++++++ Description ++++++++++++++++++++
// To measure 2fa functionality
// ++++++++++++++++++++ Prerequisites ++++++++++++++++++++
// On device non-whitelisted auth agent such as HPAC and Safecom must be installed.
//
